{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T02:40:50.422Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.11.07.02.71.001","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CSR20261107001_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Sulawesi Utara","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 07 November 2026, 10:10 WITA di sebagian wilayah Sulawesi Utara, khususnya di RANOWULU.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 07 November 2026, 12:30 WITA.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1794016800000,"effective":1794017400000,"expires":1794025800000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CSR/2026/11/07/infografis.jpg","province":"Sulawesi Utara","districts":{"primary":["RANOWULU"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[1.557,125.172],[1.537,125.168],[1.504,125.171],[1.487,125.158],[1.463,125.125],[1.452,125.121],[1.446,125.101],[1.432,125.102],[1.429,125.098],[1.427,125.085],[1.424,125.08],[1.427,125.078],[1.453,125.073],[1.455,125.03],[1.491,125.051],[1.499,125.064],[1.497,125.076],[1.523,125.072],[1.537,125.077],[1.56,125.077],[1.566,125.079],[1.56,125.095],[1.571,125.156],[1.557,125.172]]],"hasCap":true},{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.11.07.02.82.003","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CMU20261107003_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Maluku Utara","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 07 November 2026, 11:20 WIT di sebagian wilayah Maluku Utara, khususnya di JAILOLO